#NEXUS

[ agnolín2023a_fig11: Colossosaur summary cladogram. Titanosauria, Colossosauria, 'Rin' (printed abbreviation, kept as printed) and 'Longkosauria' (as printed), each beside a node dot, are kept as internal labels. One three-way node: Puertasaurus, Drusilasaura and the Argentinosaurus-Patagotitan pair, stem entering at Drusilasaura's height. 15 tips, 1 polytomies (3 children); 4 printed clade names kept as internal node labels. Random-sample case (seed 20261122). Topology transcribed from the figure image and checked node by node; topology only. ]

BEGIN TAXA;
    DIMENSIONS NTAX=15;
    TAXLABELS
        Other_Titanosauria
        Rinconsaurus_caudamirus
        Muyelensaurus_pecheni
        Overosaurus_paradasorum
        Arrudatitan_maximus
        Bonitasaura_salgadoi
